    {
      "id": "5fd2f2f88d79820023b0c157",
      "text": "Vivaldi",
      "userId": "5d131fa66fe2890017055332",
      "created": 1607660298,
      "updated": 1607660298
    },
    {
      "id": "60814226246f5900002fb40b",
      "text": "https://vivaldi.com/ja/",
      "userId": "6055950b87138f0022246f59",
      "created": 1619083814,
      "updated": 1619083814
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f684",
      "text": "Vivaldi ブラウザ: 超絶便利。タブ管理や広告で悩まないブラウザ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f685",
      "text": "> [https://vivaldi.com/wp-content/uploads/vivaldi_og.png]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f686",
      "text": "> ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f687",
      "text": "> [https://vivaldi.com/ja/]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f688",
      "text": "> ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f689",
      "text": "> Vivaldi ブラウザはトラッカーと広告をブロックし、速くて安全なプライバシー配慮型ブラウザ。カスタマイズと便利機能で、毎日のネット作業がさらにスムーズに。Windows, macOS, Linux, Android で Vivaldi！",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f68a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f68b",
      "text": "四季 (春が有名) を作曲したバロック時代の音楽家ちゃうんかい[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f68c",
      "text": "\t[Antonio Vivaldi]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f68d",
      "text": " あー[Opera]からの、、ということなのか(今気づいた)[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f68e",
      "text": " \t！！！！[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f68f",
      "text": "　[ヴィヴァルディ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f690",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f691",
      "text": "iOS版が最近出た",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f692",
      "text": " Androidは数年前から愛用している[wogikaze.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f693",
      "text": " 　[Vivaldi 3.0・Android版ブラウザリリース | Vivaldi Browser https://vivaldi.com/ja/blog/1-day-2-big-vivaldi-browser-releases/]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19123000000000029f694",
      "text": "　[Apple ユーザーの皆さまお待たせしました：iOS 版 Vivaldi 正式リリース | Vivaldi Browser https://vivaldi.com/ja/blog/vivaldi-browser-launches-on-ios/]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216227,
      "updated": 1794216227
    },
    {
      "id": "6af19126000000000029f695",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794216230,
      "updated": 1794216230
    },
    {
      "id": "5fd2f30a05533200005a8e0a",
      "text": "WEBパネルモードがめっちゃ便利",
      "userId": "5d131fa66fe2890017055332",
      "created": 1607660298,
      "updated": 1607660308
    },
    {
      "id": "5fd2f30a05533200005a8e0b",
